sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Intake Staff
    participant UI as WinForms UI
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant APP as Application and Domain
    participant DB as Repository and MariaDB

    rect rgb(234, 242, 249)
        Note over Staff,DB: Create Appraisal Request
        Staff->>UI: Select New Appraisal Request
        UI->>API: POST /api/appraisal-requests
        activate API
        API->>APP: CreateAppraisalRequest command
        activate APP
        APP->>APP: Authorize actor and normalize input
        APP->>APP: Validate initial Client, Contact and Vehicle references
        alt Request is invalid
            APP-->>API: Validation errors with stable codes
            API-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable Entity
            UI-->>Staff: Display field and workflow errors
        else Request is valid
            APP->>APP: Assign UUID, request number, Draft status and row version 1
            APP->>DB: Begin transaction
            activate DB
            DB->>DB: Insert appraisal_requests row
            DB->>DB: Insert creation audit event
            DB-->>APP: Commit successful
            deactivate DB
            APP-->>API: Created request summary
            API-->>UI: 201 Created with location and rowVersion
            UI-->>Staff: Open Draft workspace
        end
        deactivate APP
        deactivate API
    end

    rect rgb(240, 247, 242)
        Note over Staff,DB: Update Appraisal Request
        Staff->>UI: Edit request and select Save
        UI->>API: PUT /api/appraisal-requests/{id} with expectedRowVersion
        activate API
        API->>APP: UpdateAppraisalRequest command
        activate APP
        APP->>DB: Load request and related state
        activate DB
        DB-->>APP: Request, status and current rowVersion
        deactivate DB
        alt Request does not exist
            APP-->>API: Not found
            API-->>UI: 404 Not Found
            UI-->>Staff: Request no longer exists
        else Status is Accepted or Converted
            APP-->>API: Ordinary update prohibited
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict with amendment-required code
            UI-->>Staff: Offer authorized amendment workflow
        else Status permits editing
            APP->>APP: Validate lifecycle, Client, Contact, Intended Use, Intended Users and Vehicle rules
            alt Validation fails
                APP-->>API: Validation errors and warnings
                API-->>UI: 422 Unprocessable Entity
                UI-->>Staff: Display corrections required
            else Validation passes
                APP->>DB: Begin transaction
                activate DB
                DB->>DB: UPDATE where request ID and row_version match
                alt No row updated
                    DB-->>APP: Concurrency conflict
                    APP-->>API: CONCURRENCY-001 with current version
                    API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
                    UI-->>Staff: Refresh or reconcile changes
                else Update succeeds
                    DB->>DB: Increment row_version and write audit event
                    DB-->>APP: Commit updated request
                    APP-->>API: Updated request summary
                    API-->>UI: 200 OK with new rowVersion
                    UI-->>Staff: Show saved state
                end
                deactivate DB
            end
        end
        deactivate APP
        deactivate API
    end

    rect rgb(252, 244, 238)
        Note over Staff,DB: Delete or Lifecycle Disposition
        Staff->>UI: Select Delete, Cancel or Withdraw
        UI->>API: DELETE /api/appraisal-requests/{id} with reason and expectedRowVersion
        activate API
        API->>APP: DeleteOrDisposeAppraisalRequest command
        activate APP
        APP->>DB: Load request, references and retention state
        activate DB
        DB-->>APP: Status, rowVersion and dependency summary
        deactivate DB
        alt Request does not exist
            APP-->>API: Not found
            API-->>UI: 404 Not Found
            UI-->>Staff: Request no longer exists
        else Request is Accepted, Converted or retention protected
            APP-->>API: Deletion prohibited
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict with preservation rule
            UI-->>Staff: Preserve request and use an authorized disposition or amendment
        else Request is Submitted or UnderReview
            APP-->>API: Hard deletion prohibited and disposition required
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict with allowed Cancel or Withdraw actions
            UI->>API: POST cancel or withdraw with reason and expectedRowVersion
            API->>APP: Apply lifecycle disposition
            APP->>DB: Update status and write disposition audit event
            DB-->>APP: Commit with incremented rowVersion
            APP-->>API: Disposition completed
            API-->>UI: 200 OK
            UI-->>Staff: Show Cancelled or Withdrawn status
        else Request is unreferenced Draft and purge policy permits
            APP->>DB: Begin transaction
            activate DB
            DB->>DB: Delete request-owned Draft children
            DB->>DB: Delete Draft request and write deletion audit record
            DB-->>APP: Commit successful
            deactivate DB
            APP-->>API: Deletion completed
            API-->>UI: 204 No Content
            UI-->>Staff: Remove request from workspace
        else Draft purge is not permitted
            APP-->>API: Non-destructive disposition required
            API-->>UI: 409 Conflict with Cancel or Withdraw action
            UI-->>Staff: Choose an allowed disposition
        end
        deactivate APP
        deactivate API
    end

    rect rgb(245, 243, 250)
        Note over Staff,DB: List Appraisal Requests
        Staff->>UI: Open Appraisal Request list and apply filters
        UI->>API: GET /api/appraisal-requests with query, status, clientId and page
        activate API
        API->>APP: ListAppraisalRequests query
        activate APP
        APP->>APP: Authorize scope and validate paging and filters
        APP->>DB: Execute indexed count and page query
        activate DB
        DB-->>APP: Total count and request summaries
        deactivate DB
        APP-->>API: Paged result with rowVersion values
        API-->>UI: 200 OK with items and paging metadata
        UI-->>Staff: Display sortable filtered list
        deactivate APP
        deactivate API
    end

    Note over UI,DB: All mutations use UTC audit timestamps, actor identity, stable UUIDs and optimistic concurrency.
